{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920170/extras/f6bc1a58676877946af8bf2e988dd27c.poster.avif?t=1764870441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920170/extras/f6bc1a58676877946af8bf2e988dd27c.webm?t=1764870441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920170/extras/f6bc1a58676877946af8bf2e988dd27c.mp4?t=1764870441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lust Effect</strong> [18+] is a first-person shooter with adult content. You play as Ashley, a woman who wakes with no memory and finds herself trapped among xenomorphic creatures. As you explore shadowy corridors, you piece together your past - including intimate moments - and interact with characters who may become allies or objects of desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920170/extras/636086724a4e822aeb1fb4dc24a204b1.poster.avif?t=1764870441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920170/extras/636086724a4e822aeb1fb4dc24a204b1.webm?t=1764870441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920170/extras/636086724a4e822aeb1fb4dc24a204b1.mp4?t=1764870441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending sci-fi and survival horror, Lust Effect challenges you to manage scarce resources - ammo, oxygen, and even social rapport - to survive escalating dangers aboard a hostile station. Every step through its dim hallways uncovers fragments of Ashley\u2019s history and opens new possibilities for connection, temptation, and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920170/extras/aa91e519541bc6dab0e2abe2e7119be4.poster.avif?t=1764870441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920170/extras/aa91e519541bc6dab0e2abe2e7119be4.webm?t=1764870441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920170/extras/aa91e519541bc6dab0e2abe2e7119be4.mp4?t=1764870441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Game Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Varied station levels</strong><br></li><li><strong>Survival resourse</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Tension and temptation</strong><br></li><li><strong>Epic boss fight</strong><br></li><li><strong>Story-driven campaign</strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for a lust-fueled space adventure?</p></li></ul></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cull the Weak I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920170/f4a3aaba395a48bea68778dc9edfbf03d1be5001.jpg"},{"name":"Cull the Weak II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920170/16fd4ba08f31527f45fff12791f4b4e0d7ddf4ae.jpg"},{"name":"Catch the Pitch I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920170/f318269ecab2b98b6cb7bbe0568e269b14c7b60a.jpg"},{"name":"Catch the Pitch II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920170/54fa78f856a64503108607936683e058410d0334.jpg"},{"name":"See the Unseen I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920170/92c321c3737a13f7872ed9367218244b5f2b88e1.jpg"},{"name":"See the Unseen II","path":